      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae nae Abasiiria na Abaisraeli egesusuro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro amang’ana igoro ya Damesiki:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Naama! Damesiki tokogenderera koba omochie; nosarigwe, otumbwe amo obe ebinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emechie y’Aroeri neng’anywe etigwe ere bosa. Nigo eraabe amarisio. Chitugo nchibe chikorara aroro, na onde tari orachioboyie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene bw’Emeganda nigo agoteeba iga: Chiburi chi’Efraimu nchisarigwe kegima, na oborwoti bwa Damesiki mbosirigwe; na abatigari b’Abasiiria mbaurwe obonene bwabo buna Abaisraeli bauretwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase engaki eyio obonene bw’abaanto ba Yakobo mbokeeigwe kegima, na obonetu bw’emebere yabo mboree.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo eraabe buna ekero omogesi akogesa namaboko aye ebigara bi’endagera eteneine, na buna ekero omonto agochora ebigara bi’endagera ase ense omweremu y’Abarefai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, abanto abake mono mbatigareo, banga buna ekero omote bw’emezeituni okonyegerigwa, amazeituni abere, gose atato, atigare ase omote igoro, na ane, gose atano, atigare ase chinsagia. Nab’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio abanto mbarigie ogokonywa korwa ase Omotongi obo, mbabe namasikani ase Oyore Omochenu bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibagosemeria ebisasimero ebire emeremo y’amaboko abo, gose tibakorigereria emete eteneneirie Asera, enyasae yabo enkuungu, gose ebisasimero bi’ogosambera ubani, ebi baroisirie nebiara biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio emechie yabo egiteire chindwaki neebe buna amatombe are ase amanani na ase ebitunwa igoro, ayio atigetwe ekero Abaisraeli bachete aroro. Emechie eyio nesarigwe etigare ere bosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe mwebire Nyasae ore ogotooreka kwaino, na timori koinyora Egetare kere obotamero bwaino. Ase ayio nigo mokoroisia emegondo emiya, mwasimeka emesabibu emiegarori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya y’are koba ng’a ase rituko erio okoyesimeka noyegitere orobago, na mambia yaye esiche, okwama kwaye nigo korasirigwe ekero rituko ri’emechando rirache, rire nobororo botari gokwaneka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebisaku bire ababisa bikobugwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obee! Okwogana okwo kw’abaanto abange nogwa ki? Nigo bakwogana buna amaache ’enyancha. Okong’ung’ura okwo kw’ebisaku nogwa ki? Nigo baokong’ung’ura buna amaache are ne chinguru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto b’ebisaku nigo baokong’ung’ura buna amaache amange, korende Omonene nabatogonyere, nabarabwo batame gochia aare: mbaserigwe, babe buna omoiriro okoirurukigwa nomwaga igoro ase ebitunwa, na buna orotu rokoirurukigwa nekembugu‐mbugu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero kia mogoroba, rora, obwoba mboreo, na mambia botarakiamoka, abakwoboyia tibaiyo. Eke nakio egetari ki’abachandi baito, abwo bagotosakora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
